# Direct products of irreducible representations (selection rules)

crystod-group --product T2g T2g --point-group m-3m

* Point group *
m-3m

* Direct product *
T2g*T2g

* Result *
 1(A1g) + 1(Eg) + 1(T1g) + 1(T2g)



# Triple products work too (e.g. Raman/IR selection logic)
crystod-group --product T2g T2g T1u --point-group m-3m

* Point group *
m-3m

* Direct product *
T2g*T2g*T1u

* Result *
 1(A1u) + 1(A2u) + 2(Eu) + 4(T1u) + 3(T2u)



# Show the character table of a point group
crystod-group --table --point-group 3m

* Point group *
3m

* IrRep Table *
table:
irrep  E(1)  C3(2)  sgv(3)
   A1     1      1       1
   A2     1      1      -1
    E     2     -1       0
